          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5. Using the digits 1, 4, 0, 8, and 6 make: (a) the decimal number closest to 30 (b) the smallest possible decimal number between 100 and 1000.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
