            0.628
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Using the digits 1, 4, 0, 8, and 6, we can make: (a) 40.168 (b) 104.68"
