          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.181,
            0.645,
            0.797,
            0.687
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6. Will a decimal number with more digits be greater than a decimal number with fewer digits?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.177,
            0.69,
            0.875,
            0.729
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " No. It is not necessary. For example, 2.05 (2 digits after decimal) vs 2.5 (1 digit after decimal). 2.5 >2.05"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
